WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.668
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with selected

00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:06.387
artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.240
Choose finished works and give each a title label. Name a design choice that a

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.920
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:17.621
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:22.687
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question.
